        "created_at": "2017-11-17T18:11:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The FAQ over at Handleabra mentions that family sharing does not work for DLC on IOS, but what about for Android phones on the Google play store?</p><p>If not is there another way around it. Like maybe if I log into my sons phone, download the game and DLC and then he switches to his ID.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>I'm not looking to take advantage,&nbsp; I just already own this game 3 times over at this point(I own it on all three platforms with the full DLC), so I am hoping that the family share works so I can save some cash :)</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
